  ["Anuncios, encuestas y todo lo que pasa en la hermandad."] = "Announcements, polls and everything that happens in the guild.",
  ["Apagado: tu addon no apunta nada tuyo, pero sigues viendo la lista."] = "Off: your addon records nothing of yours, but you still see the list.",
  ["Aparta solo dados que puntúen (unos, cincos, tríos…)."] = "Set aside only dice that score (ones, fives, three of a kind…).",
