  ["Jefe: %s. %s. Los organizadores cambian el nombre y el jefe; tú decides quién está."] = "Leader: %s. %s. The organisers change the name and the leader; you decide who is in.",
  ["Jefes %s/%s"] = "Bosses %s/%s",
  ["Jefes de banda distintos que la hermandad ha matado (lo apunta el addon de quien estaba allí)."] = "Different raid bosses the guild has killed (the addon of someone who was there writes it down).",
  ["Jefes derrotados"] = "Bosses defeated",
  ["Jugador"] = "Player",
  ["Jugador o hermandad"] = "Player or guild",
  ["Jugadores de la otra facción que matan a gente de la hermandad fuera de mazmorras y campos de batalla. Quien los caza se lleva su recompensa."] = "Players of the other faction who kill guild members outside dungeons and battlegrounds. Whoever hunts them takes their bounty.",
