  ["Varias hermandades amigas"] = "Several friendly guilds",
  ["Varias hermandades amigas se unen. Cada una sigue siendo la misma, con su maestro y sus normas."] = "Several friendly guilds join together. Each one stays the same, with its master and its rules.",
